Third-party material of this repository

proof/pharmaverse/data/adsl.xpt and adae.xpt are the data sets adsl and adae of the R package pharmaverseadam 1.3.0
(https://github.com/pharmaverse/pharmaverseadam), Apache License 2.0, written as SAS transport files without a change
(proof/pharmaverse/data/make_xpt.R). The subjects are those of the CDISC pilot study (public example data).

The references are cited, not copied: their numbers were read from the published outputs of
- the R Consortium R Submission Pilot 1, https://github.com/RConsortium/submissions-pilot1 (commit ba1d3e7af60e281def02df11c76c64f8352526f4), and
- the pharmaverse examples, https://github.com/pharmaverse/examples (branch gh-pages, commit bcaacf1143fbb1e4f59a46ed14194564a2e72eae),
into proof/*/reference/*.csv, with the place each number was read from. No code of either repository is included.
The ADaM transport files of the R Submission Pilot 1 are not included: proof/run.sas says where to get them.

examples/data/*.xpt are data sets of the R packages pharmaverseadam 1.3.0 (adsl, adae, advs, adlb, adtte_onco,
adrs_onco; https://github.com/pharmaverse/pharmaverseadam) and pharmaversesdtm 1.4.0 (ds, ex;
https://github.com/pharmaverse/pharmaversesdtm), Apache License 2.0, written as SAS transport files by
examples/data/make_data.R: subsets, no values changed (some records and variables left out, a few variables derived
from the data of the packages added; examples/data/NOTICE). docs/examples holds what the examples gave on SAS 9.4.
